{"seq":10,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/hermes-haiku-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ar-04-mateo-hartford-mail/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T23:51:20.024Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"011e9fe83dae0333a68bc2622610859c28aae9d4666d9b891f7033d4aef5ad3d","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"request_approval","kind":"approval","args":{"action":"Save a mail draft from gsato@pemberline.com to mateoquiroga@vantorre-group.example (Mateo Quiroga, Vantorre) with subject 'Hartford gate kiosk incident, 3 August 2026: summary', body as in details. Mail is addressed outside pemberline.com.","authorization":"Ruth Calloway (CRO) must approve any mail addressed outside pemberline.com, even as a draft (admin rule 3).","details":{"requested_by":"gideon.sato","from":"gsato@pemberline.com","to":"mateoquiroga@vantorre-group.example","subject":"Hartford gate kiosk incident, 3 August 2026: summary","body":"Hi Mateo,\n\nSummary of the Hartford gate kiosk incident on 3 August 2026:\n\n- Kiosks offline: 3 August 2026, from about 10:42 AM. Both inbound gate lanes showed a white screen after badge scan. Scheduling still worked from the dispatch office.\n- Lanes restored: Kiosk 1 was back at 11:03 AM (trailer 8836 checked in). Both lanes were confirmed working as of 11:07 AM on 3 August.\n- Status-page access: your login was still getting 'access denied' on the status page. This is tracked in ticket INC-4821, where the screenshot is attached. Your admin account can open Pemberline Dock and see arrivals.\n\nCarrowmere Cloud is checking the Hartford gateway route, and the reconnect log has been sent to Odile Brandt.\n\nGideon","source":"#inc-vtg-hartford, 2026-08-03 messages by gideon.sato, mateo.quiroga, odile.brandt"},"channel":{"thread":{"channel":"#strategic-pod","ts":"1791986400.000123"}}},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"pending_action":{"id":"pending-gbrain-memory-2026-10/hermes-haiku-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ar-04-mateo-hartford-mail/r1-1","requested_by":"assistant","action"